<title>JAPAN: Daiwa Sec to post appraisal loss of 20.47 bln yen.</title>
<headline>Daiwa Sec to post appraisal loss of 20.47 bln yen.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daiwa Securities Co Ltd said on Tuesday that it expected to post an appraisal loss of 20.47 billion yen on securities holdings at the end of the fiscal year through March 1997.</p>
</text>
